{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你们当在耶路撒冷的街上跑来跑去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在宽阔处寻找，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看有一人行公义求诚实没有？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若有，我就赦免这城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的人虽然指着永生的耶和华起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所起的誓实在是假的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你的眼目不是看顾诚实吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你击打他们，他们却不伤恸；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你毁灭他们，他们仍不受惩治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们使脸刚硬过于磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不肯回头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我说：这些人实在是贫穷的，是愚昧的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为不晓得耶和华的作为","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和他们 神的法则。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要去见尊大的人，对他们说话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们晓得耶和华的作为","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和他们 神的法则。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪知，这些人齐心将轭折断，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挣开绳索。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"因此，林中的狮子必害死他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晚上","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"的豺狼必灭绝他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子要在城外窥伺他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡出城的必被撕碎；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们的罪过极多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背道的事也加增了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"我怎能赦免你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女离弃我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又指着那不是神的起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他们饱足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们就行奸淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成群地聚集在娼妓家里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们像喂饱的马到处乱跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各向他邻舍的妻发嘶声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：我岂不因这些事讨罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不报复这样的国民呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要上她葡萄园的墙施行毁坏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不可毁坏净尽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只可除掉她的枝子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为不属耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"原来以色列家和犹大家大行诡诈攻击我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华丢弃以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"他们不认耶和华，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这并不是他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"灾祸必不临到我们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀剑和饥荒，我们也看不见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知的话必成为风；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"道也不在他们里面。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这灾必临到他们身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"所以耶和华—万军之 神如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为百姓说这话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使我的话在你口中为火，使他们为柴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这火便将他们烧灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使一国的民从远方来攻击你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是强盛的国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是从古而有的国。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的言语你不晓得，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的话你不明白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的箭袋是敞开的坟墓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都是勇士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必吃尽你的庄稼和你的粮食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你儿女该吃的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必吃尽你的牛羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃尽你的葡萄和无花果；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又必用刀毁坏你所倚靠的坚固城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和华说：「就是到那时，我也不将你们毁灭净尽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["百姓若说：『耶和华—我们的 神为什么向我们行这一切事呢？』你就对他们说：『你们怎样离弃耶和华",{"noteId":7},"，在你们的地上事奉外邦神，也必照样在不属你们的地上事奉外邦人。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神警告他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"当传扬在雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报告在犹大说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧无知的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们有眼不看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有耳不听，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在当听这话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：你们怎么不惧怕我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以永远的定例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用沙为海的界限，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水不得越过。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你们在我面前还不战兢吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"波浪虽然翻腾，却不能逾越；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然匉訇，却不能过去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但这百姓有背叛忤逆的心；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们叛我而去，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心内也不说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们应当敬畏耶和华—我们的 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他按时赐雨，就是秋雨春雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又为我们定收割的节令，永存不废。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪孽使这些事转离你们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪恶使你们不能得福。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为在我民中有恶人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们埋伏窥探，好像捕鸟的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们设立圈套陷害人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"笼内怎样满了雀鸟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的房中也照样充满诡诈；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以他们得成为大，而且富足。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们肥胖光润，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作恶过甚，不为人伸冤！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是不为孤儿伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不使他亨通，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不为穷人辨屈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：我岂不因这些事讨罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂不报复这样的国民呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"国中有可惊骇、可憎恶的事：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是先知说假预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司借他们把持权柄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓也喜爱这些事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了结局你们怎样行呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或译：野地","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":6}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是我","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}